<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears Ponar for public trade.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears Ponar for public trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission on Thursday approved for public trade 866,500 shares of hydraulic machines maker Ponar Wadowice, including an initial public offering of 67,000 new shares.</p>
<p>The company's president Andrzej Dzierugo said Ponar planned to enter the bourse's parallel market in late 1997 or early 1998.</p>
